<title>ITALY: BCI H1 1996 net profits fall.</title>
<headline>BCI H1 1996 net profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent net profit	 180.3  vs 219.5</p>
<p>    Consolidated net profit 207.1  vs 238.6  </p>
<p>Parent company results</p>
<p>    Net interest income    1,502   vs  up 2.4 percent</p>
<p>Profits from trading activities and services</p>
<p>				     953.4 vs  up 7.5 percent</p>
<p>    Operating income	 2,455.4 vs  up 4.3 percent</p>
<p>    Net operating profit     576.8 vs  573.2</p>
<p>    Ordinary profit	    323.8 vs  416.1</p>
<p>    Total deposits	 107,160   vs  up 1.9 percent</p>
<p>    Total loans	     96,899   vs  up 4.0 percent</p>
<p>    Shareholders equity    8,081   vs  n/a</p>
<p>Group consolidated results</p>
<p>    Net interest income    2,313.4 vs  2,427.6</p>
<p>    Operating income	 3,379   vs  3,404.8</p>
<p>    Net operating profit     894.6 vs  1,009.7</p>
<p>    Ordinary profit	    415.3 vs    583.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Banca Commerciale Italiana.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
